# The only piece of the design handoff the repository does not keep: a 58 KB
# export from the design tool, kept by HANDOFF.md §17 for reference and
# explicitly "not part of the build, not to be shipped". Nothing imports it and
# nothing can regenerate it, so a clone gains a file it cannot use or reproduce.
#
# reference/ and docs/ are tracked on purpose and must stay that way. The ten
# captures in reference/screenshots/ are the only visual baseline that exists —
# step 10 of the D2 order in docs/frontend-contract-map.md re-checks against
# them, and a clone that lacks them cannot perform it. HANDOFF.md is tracked and
# cites both directories throughout; excluding them would leave it pointing at
# files nobody has.
reference/original-prototype.dc.html
